clunker that its time to upgrade.  I can continue to use my Pentiun 90
and Micro$oft Win95, but I have developed this aversion to Billy
"Pieman" Gates and His empire, and would like to try out something new.
I'm about to bite the bullet and buy a DEC Alpha machine (XL300 or so),
