items.
1. Redhat 5.0 will not install correctly.
   - Turns out that the mke2fs sent with 5.0 will not handle
     3 gig drives.
   - work around. Use the 4.2 disks DCG sent with the system. (Thanks)
2. Getting Applix to convert files.
   - The filters are in <install dir>applix/axfilter/*
   - below is the script I use for calling up a msword doc.

#! /bin/bash
echo $1 > /tmp/command
/usr/local/applix/axfilter/inww6 $1 $1.tmp
export out=`echo $1 | sed s/.doc/.aw/`
/usr/local/applix/axfilter/outax4 $1.tmp $out
applix -wp $out&

   This is the same script I use to view Word documents from netscape
mail and Navigator.
   ? How do I stop applix from starting up an extra window?
   ? Which filters are for powerpoint files?

3. Getting EM86 and kernel 2.0.33 to work when em86 says that
   kernel does not support 31 bit addressing.
   The patch file
     alpha-patches-2.0.33-0.1.gz
  That I found at 
     ftp.nllgg.nl/pub/linux/alpha/
  Was missing the following:

--- linux/include/asm-alpha/a.out.h   Thu Nov  9 03:04:33 1995
+++ linux.em86/include/asm-alpha/a.out.h      Wed Oct  8 12:50:03 1997
@@ -90,7 +90,8 @@
 
 #ifdef __KERNEL__
 
-#define STACK_TOP (0x00120000000UL)
+#define STACK_TOP ((current->personality & ADDR_MAX_32BIT) ?
0x100000000UL : \
+      ((current->personality&ADDR_MAX_31BIT) ? 0x80000000UL :
0x00120000000UL))
 
 #endif
 
4. Getting egcs to compile correctly.
   - Had to upgrade to new binutils.

    ftp://ftp.nllgg.nl/pub/linux/alpha/binutils-2.8.1.0.23-1.alpha.rpm

5. No keyboard with Linux 2.0.33
   Say yes to TGA console and VGA console.

New Questions?
Is there a version of alpha doom?
Is em86 going have updated libraries realesed for gclib 2.0?

Thanks All.
I hope this information helps someone out there.

