2. replace your stock RH 5.0 glibc-2.0.5 with the one on gatekeeper.dec.com:

	/pub/DEC/Linux-Alpha/Kernels/glibc-205+.22jan.gz

Use the first method if you're currently running EGCS or any of the GLIBC
updates.

Good luck.

